  "description": [
    {
      "value": "<p>A comparative posting on the northern shelf, sent to test whether the flat-working sequence built in the home galaxy would survive being carried across the gap. It did not, in the useful way: the sequence held for the midden ring and failed completely for the aggregation ground, which is scheduled against the year rather than the tide. The team also produced the first metric survey of the ladder terraces. The comparative report was two years late because half of it was written on the ship home and the other half was rewritten on arrival.</p>",
      "inLanguage": [{ "id": ["core.peerdb.org", "LANGUAGE", "en-GB"] }]
